{"version":1,"key":"card:471","content":{"id":471,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b0cbdaf-3d80-40db-a0c8-13acda41accb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要在属性被访问时执行一段代码，必须使用一些魔法方法。由下面的四个魔法方法定义。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"94ff5cb3-0de6-4c39-81cf-949b57695178","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c864b8b7-69df-42fc-882c-fc5d39e2a917","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad0980a4-3d8c-4030-96dc-12d126b8c84c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattribute__(self, name)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在属性被访问时自动调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cdec36e8-8cb1-4136-a73a-bc3d9153c238","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38939747-121f-4e49-8d57-e81b0ae7fe4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getattr__(self, name)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在属性被访问而"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"f74dc4d7-f95e-42f8-9a91-defdf5e12a62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对象没有这样的属性时"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"自动调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"88018600-5ac0-4e2c-8650-2b159b4de30c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb9b